absorb	one
progressive	one
outside_criticism	one
outside_ability	one
engross	one
efficient	one
# "Ability" means able persons in absorb ("principal ability of the country") and capacity in progressive ("ability of the body itself").
# Each sense stays inside its own claim and is used the same way in every statement that uses that claim, so neither claim is in two senses.
# In outside_ability, "such ability" refers back to "equal ability outside the body", meaning able persons, in all three statements.
# No premise or assumption joins the two senses of "ability", so there is no bridge.
